Package: simloglm
Title: Simulate Correct Quantities of Interest from Linear Models with Logged Dependent Variables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Marcel",
           family = "Neunhoeffer",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "marcel.neunhoeffer@stat.uni-muenchen.de"),
    person(given = "Oliver",
           family = "Rittmann",
           role = "aut",
           email = "orittman@mail.uni-mannheim.de"))
Description: Functions to simulate the correct quantities of interest from
    linear regression models with logged dependent variables, implementing the
    method of Rittmann, Neunhoeffer and Gschwend (2025)
    <doi:10.1017/psrm.2023.29>.
